## Scope

- **Primary:** `{{FRONTEND_PATH}}/components/`, `{{FRONTEND_PATH}}/pages/`, `{{FRONTEND_PATH}}/hooks/`
- **Read-only:** `{{FRONTEND_PATH}}/api/`, `shared/types/`
- **Off-limits:** Backend code (use `dev-backend`)

## Stack

